@startuml fr09-studying-now
' Origin: drafted with AI assistance (Claude Code) from FR-09 in docs/02-requirements.md; reviewed by the author.
title FR-09 Live "studying now" board (stream processing)
|Focus|
start
:Publish FocusSessionStarted / Ended\n→ focus.sessions (key = userId);
|Social streams|
:Consume focus.sessions;
if (event type?) then (Started)
  :Upsert Presence(userId, sessionId,\ntopicId, startedAt) in presence-store;
else (Ended)
  :Tombstone: delete userId from presence-store;
endif
|Student (viewer)|
:GET /friends/studying-now\nor GET /rooms/{id}/studying-now;
|Social|
if (friends board?) then (yes)
  :Load accepted friends;
  :Interactive query: presence of each friend;
  :Keep only friends whose sharing is ON\n(checked now, against SharingSetting);
  :Elapsed = now − startedAt ("12m 5s" + seconds);
  :200 list (userId, topicId, elapsed);
else (room count)
  if (viewer is a room member?) then (no)
    :404;
    stop
  endif
  :Interactive query: presence of every member;
  :Count them, whatever their sharing setting\n(anonymous number);
  :200 {studyingCount, memberCount};
endif
stop
@enduml
